# Cloudflare Pages publishes the repo root (`directory: .`): anything committed
# here is served publicly at adrific.fi. So only public site assets get committed.
# Everything below is kept LOCAL (the impeccable tooling still reads the docs on
# disk). To version-control these instead, scope the Pages publish dir to a
# site-only folder and remove the relevant lines here.

# Separate project (VAREK) — reference only; MUST NOT be served publicly.
md-examples/

# Project-management & design docs — local working files, not part of the site.
PRODUCT.md
DESIGN.md
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md
README.md
ROADMAP.md
TODO.md
PLAN.md
docs/

# Dev tooling / skills / live-mode state.
.claude/
impeccable/
.impeccable/
.github/skills/

# Logs & local cruft
*.log
configure-logs.txt
node_modules/
.DS_Store
